@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-16  View permitted reports or history
' Requirements: PERM-02 PERM-03 PERM-04 REPORT-01 REPORT-02 REPORT-03 NOTICE-01 DATA-01 P-07
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Staff requester" as U
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
U -> S: Request permitted report/history with relevant filters
alt Faculty requesting owned-course student results
  S --> U: Show individual progress and results only for owned courses
else Program Head requesting learning reports
  S --> U: Show course/revision/date-filtered aggregate participation
  note over S
  Date range selects course starts; show completion as of now.
  Retained deactivated accounts remain in historical totals.
  Overall participation counts each student once.
  Per-quiz averages use each student's highest submitted score.
  Keep diagnostic separate from course-quiz outcomes.
  end note
  alt Group has fewer than 5 students
    S --> U: Show participation count; hide completion and quiz statistics
  else Group has at least 5 students
    S --> U: Show completion breakdown and rate
    opt Particular quiz has at least 5 contributing students
      S --> U: Show quiz statistics and contributing count
    end
  end
else Administrator requesting administrative history
  S --> U: Show permitted actor, action, target, time, and reason
else Wrong role or ownership
  S --> U: Refuse access without exposing restricted records
end
note over U,S
Program Head: no individual learning-record drill-down.
Administrator: no individual quiz results or private chat.
Empty denominator: show no data, not a misleading rate.
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-16 | Product behavior
@enduml
